          "id": "6955739ee67a3ea4fc59c51faa4b9339613e1d3f",
          "message": "chore: Batch-resolve `ctids` in Top-K. (#6465)\n\n## What\n\nBatch-resolve `ctids` in TopK.\n\n## Why\n\n#6444 makes it more important to batch access to `ctids`, and this\ncodepath was already a bad citizen in that regard. Additionally, there\nwas lots of unnecessary complexity around making Top-K results lazy,\nwhen in reality Top-K results are always all sitting in memory already.",
