          "distinct": true,
          "id": "e02631a2742e3ab994a971c68baf874a4c9f2bdf",
          "message": "ci: remove routine benchmark Slack notifications (#6570)\n\nRoutine benchmark result messages and Stressgres graph uploads are no\nlonger needed in Slack. Remove these notifications, Stressgres PNG\ngeneration, and the unused Slack credentials and display-label inputs\nfrom the composite actions and their workflow callers.\n\nQuery benchmarks and Stressgres continue publishing metrics to GitHub\nPages and posting regression comments on GitHub. Workflow failure\nnotifications still use `paradedb/actions/slack-alert@v14` in the GitHub\nupdates channel.\n\nValidation: all four changed YAML files parse; `git diff --check`\npasses; compared the publishing steps and failure notification jobs\nagainst main and confirmed they are unchanged. No references to the\nremoved Slack inputs, benchmark channel secret, or `stressgres graph`\nremain under `.github`.",
          "timestamp": "2026-09-30T10:03:22-07:00",
          "tree_id": "02c9ab0a6b774c3ed439767074ee7481cc13c39b",
