          "distinct": true,
          "id": "8443266fcb05fbc66f4823cb6aa02880d8d0ff95",
          "message": "docs: Refine Cloud deployment and documentation navigation (#6478)\n\nThe docs previously described ParadeDB Cloud as coming soon and mixed\ndeployment choices with replication guidance. Introduce a Cloud page for\nthe private preview, organize Deployment and Replication navigation, and\nclarify that Cloud runs Enterprise while self-hosted Enterprise users\ncontact sales.\n\nUpdate the deployment cards, README, and getting-started pages to use\nconsistent names and links. Remove repeated Community/Enterprise\ncallouts from deployment guides, simplify Help and Support, add the\nPlatform roadmap items, and update the welcome subtitle. Keep a Cloud\nsignup button alongside GitHub stars in the header and add LinkedIn to\nthe footer.\n\nValidation: Mintlify build validation and `git diff --check` passed.\nChanged Markdown/MDX files formatted with Prettier.",
          "timestamp": "2026-09-29T17:07:53-07:00",
          "tree_id": "a01dd2db262930f7b121d53236f5658fdb5d87bc",
